y Universe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T16:02:57-08:00","id":836719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neowuf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/804910-old-world-of-darkness-videogames?p=836627#post836627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only concern is that white-wolf wants to target a mature audience, if they want to make a AAA game they really need to target a more young audience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would that be a concern? The average age of a computer and video game player is 35, and 74% of gamers are age 18 or older.<br /> <br /> I don't think White Wolf should spend any time concerned with what their rating will be, and just be concerned with staying true to the subject matter and making an enjoyable game-play experience (though I don't expect that the end result of doing that would be a mature rated game, since that seems to require intentionally being gorey rather than 